    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      375.43,
      316.45,
      629.36
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice under Sub-Section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as Amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude* which is required for a public purpose:- Description of the land or Servitude to be acquired: 11. District:- Mullaitivu 12. Divisional Secretariat:- Maritimepattu 13. Name of land:- Seeniyamoddai kadu 14. Land Owner Name:-1) Mr. S. Shanmuganathan, 2) Mrs. K. Kamaladevi, 3) Mr. N. Muththukumarasamy, 4) Mrs. Lingavathy Shelvaththurai 15. G. N. Division:- Keppapilavu Mul/102 16. Village:- Seeniyamoddai 17. Preliminary Plan No:- \u023f 152 18. Lot No.:- 1 - 14 19. Extent:- 41.7117 Hectare (103A, 00R, 11.9P) 20. Land Boundrirs",
    "fonts": [
      "IskoolaPota",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599039554595947,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      331.27,
      539.64,
      375.91
    ],
    "text": "North: Mr. S. Suntharalingam; East: Lane; South: Lane + Mr. M. Vanniyasegaram; West: Main Road + Mr. S. Thambiah + Mr. P. Kirushnapillai",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      376.64,
      539.62,
      508.16
    ],
    "text": "All person interested in the aforesaid land/lands* on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretary, Maritimepattu Mullaitivu on the 26th day of May 2016 at 10.00 a.m., and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 20th day of May, 2016 the nature of their interests in the Land, the Particulars of their claims for Compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
